usage: opsx-plan compile [-h] [-o OUTPUT] [--force]
                         [--adapter {opencode,claude-code,codex-cli}]
                         source

positional arguments:
  source                path to source markdown plan (.md)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -o OUTPUT, --output OUTPUT
                        output TOML path (default: openspec/plans/<source-
                        stem>.toml)
  --force               overwrite existing output
  --adapter {opencode,claude-code,codex-cli}
                        adapter to compile against (default: opencode)
